---
ishikawa-beta
  accTitle: Ishikawa maximum complexity showcase
  accDescr: Delivery delay is traced to process, people, platform, policy, data, and environment branches, each with three nested causes.
  Delivery delay
    Process
      Rework
        Incomplete acceptance criteria
      Handoffs
        Unclear ownership
      Queues
        Batch approval
    People
      Training
        New tooling
      Availability
        Shared specialists
      Communication
        Late escalation
    Platform
      Capacity
        Saturated workers
      Reliability
        Retry storms
      Observability
        Missing queue age
    Policy
      Approval
        Multiple sign-offs
      Scheduling
        Fixed release windows
      Compliance
        Manual evidence
    Data
      Quality
        Invalid records
      Freshness
        Delayed imports
      Schema
        Breaking changes
    Environment
      Network
        Regional latency
      Vendor
        Rate limits
      Demand
        Seasonal spikes
